Fixing the service issues

1. units first — supervision, stderr
2. one sink: (priority, subsystem, msg)
3. fold in AppendLog, AppendDebugLog, AppendDebugLogFormat, syslog
4. stderr lines, <N> priority prefix
5. journald parses it, no dependency
6. then sd_journal_send, SCRIPT=foo.lua
7. dlopen libsystemd, stderr fallback
8. one fd + mutex
9. ISO-8601, drop %c
10. SETBOOL_LOG_SCRIPT_ERRORS gates file only
